\ The mutual cycle from tests/integration/tail_boundary_mutual_cycle.1z, compiled into the binary.
\ Both words compile, and they call each other directly, so the compiled entry check is the only
\ guard on the native stack. It raises a catchable error where the binary used to die on a signal.
\ Running flat is the target.
\
\ The handler reports only that it ran, since reading the error type needs a native the
\ interpreter-free class cannot compile. The integration twins pin the type.

pong: ( n -- ) [ 1 - ping ] ;
ping: ( n -- ) [ dup 0 > [ pong ] [ drop "done" print-line ] if ] ;

[ 2000000 ping ] [ drop "caught the overflow" print-line ] recover
